    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>A healthy living tree touched becomes a treant and follows your commands for the duration. If the spell is dispelled, it immediately takes root where it stands. If you dismiss it, the treant attempts to return to its original location before taking root.</p><p><strong>Automation boundary:</strong> Create and control the treant actor manually; the system does not transform the tree or return it to its original position.</p>"
    },
